DESCRIPTION:DEZ DURON

Mon\, Dec 14th | 7:00 PM

GET TICKETS

Mon\, Dec 14th | 9:30 PM

GET TICKETS

Dez Duron brings his signature crooner style\, as seen in Broadway’s Maybe
  Happy Ending to Joe’s Pub. A night filled with the American Songbook\, Br
 oadway favorites\, modern classics as well as new original music all perfo
 rmed with a beautiful lively jazz band.

Photo credit: Jenny Anderson

Venue Joe's Pub

Runtime 75 minutes
LOCATION:Joe's Pub\, The Public Theater\, 425 Lafayette St\, New York\, NY
  10003
