BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Meow Meow: Feline Festive
DTSTART:20261222T000000Z
DTEND:20261222T011500Z
DTSTAMP:20261019T020401Z
UID:1797897600000
URL:https://publictheater.org/performances-jp/2026/m/meow-meow-feline-festive/

DESCRIPTION:MEOW MEOW: FELINE FESTIVE

Mon\, Dec 21st | 7:00 PM

GET TICKETS

Mon\, Dec 21st | 9:30 PM

GET TICKETS

Tue\, Dec 22nd | 7:00 PM

GET TICKETS

Tue\, Dec 22nd | 9:30 PM

GET TICKETS

Enter the glorious world of International Chanteuse and Comedienne Extraor
 dinaire Meow Meow these holidaze with her unique brand of holiday hilarity
  and musical mayhem. Let the festive feline wrap you in musical wonder\, p
 eals of laughter\, and loving audience encounters of the ridiculous and (p
 otentially) too close kind! A rollicking tonic for trying times\, “Feline
 Festive” will fill you with childhood wonder again\, and rekindle the true
  spirit of the holidays—sparkling good will and joy to the world! Featurin
 g a band of superb musicians\, and music ranging from jazzy vintage showbi
 z to wicked\, witty Weimar 1920’s toons\, French chansons\, and original a
 nd contemporary classics and surprises! Come one\, come all! It’s time to
 celebrate being alive!!

Photo Credit: Magnus Hastings

Venue Joe's Pub

Runtime 75 minutes
LOCATION:Joe's Pub\, The Public Theater\, 425 Lafayette St\, New York\, NY
  10003
END:VEVENT
