BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adam J. Rineer: THIRD SEX – 1930s transvestite lieder
DTSTART:20260121T000000Z
DTEND:20260121T011500Z
DTSTAMP:20261019T020611Z
UID:1768953600000
URL:https://publictheater.org/performances-jp/2027/a/adam-j-rineer-third-sex-1
 930s-transvestite-lieder/
DESCRIPTION:ADAM J. RINEER: THIRD SEX – 1930S TRANSVESTITE LIEDER

Wed\, Jan 20th | 7:00 PM

GET TICKETS

THIRD SEX: 1930's transvestite lieder is a found text song-cycle/punk caba
 ret based on the short stories\, articles\, poems\, and personal essays of
  Das 3. Geschlecht\, a transvestite magazine published in five issues from
  1930-1932 in Berlin before n*zis burned its publishing house to the groun
 d. The magazine was largely thought to be lost until it was rediscovered a
 nd reprinted in 2016. THIRD SEX brings these forgotten trans and queer nar
 ratives to life through an eclectic score inspired by the punk and experim
 ental electronic scenes of the last 90 years while examining the queer exp
 eriences of the past\, present\, and future through our vivacious stories
 of survival.​

Photo Credit: Danny Bristoll

Venue Joe's Pub

Runtime 75 minutes
LOCATION:Joe's Pub\, The Public Theater\, 425 Lafayette St\, New York\, NY
  10003
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
